--- !u!114 &458488956
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 458488955}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fd2cf5d4ed57e47e29f8c0e4c101cf4a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DemoSequencer
  steps:
  - title: 'Frozen: a rain recording on loop'
    hint: 'The ice cube. Listen for the seam: it repeats exactly.'
    root: {fileID: 966505220}
    showExtraControls: 0
  - title: 'Thawed: recordings under rules'
    hint: 'The same kind of recordings: a bed loop and 12 single drops. Random choice,
      pitch, volume and timing. One slider: intensity. (Route 1)'
    root: {fileID: 1565609724}
    showExtraControls: 0
  - title: One sine wave
    hint: 'Fourier: any sound can be built from sine waves. This is the building
      block.'
    root: {fileID: 955789194}
    showExtraControls: 0
  - title: Digital audio is numbers
    hint: About 48,000 numbers a second. Fewer steps per number (bit depth) or fewer
      numbers (holding each one) and the smooth wave becomes a staircase. Listen
      to it get buzzy.
    root: {fileID: 6478485}
    showExtraControls: 1
  - title: Noise, and shaping it
    hint: 'Noise is every frequency at once. A filter keeps some: low-pass = rumble,
      high-pass = air.'
    root: {fileID: 275683354}
    showExtraControls: 0
  - title: 'Rain, layer 1: droplets'
    hint: 'Slow random noise, raised to the 8th power, lets only its rare peaks through.
      Each peak gates a short sine: a plink.'
    root: {fileID: 886710995}
    showExtraControls: 0
  - title: 'Rain, layer 2: drips'
    hint: 'Spiky noise through a very sharp filter whose centre jumps around: bright,
      ringing drips.'
    root: {fileID: 1604122564}
    showExtraControls: 0
  - title: 'Rain, layers 3 and 4: rumble and ambience'
    hint: Noise around 333 Hz for drops on big surfaces, and a little white noise
      for the distant wash. The full patch.
    root: {fileID: 1165667550}
    showExtraControls: 0
  - title: 'One slider: drizzle to storm'
    hint: 'Intensity changes WHAT the sound is, not just how loud: more events, more
      rumble. A recording cannot do this. (Route 2)'
    root: {fileID: 444058862}
    showExtraControls: 1
  - title: 'Your turn: sculpt by ear'
    hint: 'Two building blocks you will use: a noise layer and an event layer. Move
      the sliders and listen. What could each one become?'
    root: {fileID: 1710345111}
    showExtraControls: 0
  - title: 'The reveal: three elements of fire'
    hint: 'Farnell: hissing (gas escaping), crackling (sap bursting), lapping (the
      flames'' roar). Solo each one, then all three, then intensity. (Use at the
      listening share.)'
    root: {fileID: 1041483243}
    showExtraControls: 0
  current: 0
  uiScale: 2
